---
source: crates/engage/tests/integrations/main.rs
description: Should successfully print the short help and exit.
---
A task runner with DAG-based parallelism.

Usage: engage [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  just         Run a specific task
  dot          Output Graphviz' `dot` representation of the DAG and exit
  list         Print a list of the available tasks
  completions  Print completions for a given shell
  help         Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -f, --file <FILE>              Manually choose the Engage file
  -j, --jobs <JOBS>              Maximum amount of tasks to run at once
  -l, --log-format <LOG_FORMAT>  Log format [default: normal] [possible values: normal, compact, full, pretty, json]
  -h, --help                     Print help (see more with '--help')
  -V, --version                  Print version
